error[E0277]: `Vec<u8>` is not a string, so a string bound cannot apply to it
 --> tests/ui/macros/schema_content_encoding_on_bytes.rs:8:14
  |
8 |     torrent: Vec<u8>,
  |              ^^^^^^^ not a string
  |
  = help: the trait `Textual` is not implemented for `Vec<u8>`
  = note: `min_length`, `max_length`, `pattern`, `content_encoding` and `content_media_type` apply to `String`, and to an `Option`, `Box` or `Arc` of one; implement `kynos::schema::constraints::Textual` for a newtype that is a string on the wire
  = note: or, on a `Schema` field whose serde form is a string, describe it as one with `#[schema(as = String)]`, converting through `From<&Vec<u8>>` or `via = path`
  = help: the following other types implement trait `Textual`:
            Arc<T>
            Box<T>
            Nullable<T>
            Option<T>
            std::string::String
note: required by a bound in `kynos::__private::constraints::content_encoding`
 --> src/__private/constraints.rs
  |
  | pub fn content_encoding<T: Textual + ?Sized>(_: &T, _: &str, _: Pointer<'_>, _: &mut Violations) {}
  |                            ^^^^^^^ required by this bound in `content_encoding`
